  Standalone classpath for Generate*/Verify* sketch-bitmap compat tools.
  Versions match paimon-common (RoaringBitmap ${roaringbitmap.version}=1.2.1,
  datasketches-java 4.2.0). Not part of the Rust crate publish; used only by
  local/CI JVM verification invoked from java_rust_compat tests.
